{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01068","headline":"相和歌辞 对酒二首 一 · 李白","name":"相和歌辞 对酒二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松子栖金华，安期入蓬海。\n此人古之仙，羽化竟何在？\n浮生速流电，倏忽变光彩。\n天地无凋换，容颜有迁改。\n对酒不肯饮，含情欲谁待。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01068.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01068","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}